      "content": "but it's not really \"temporary.\" you talk about rebuilding, but there's nothing to build on. the foundation is gone. people look at me with so much pity, like i'm some broken thing they have to be nice to. i'm not \"rebuilding,\" i'm just inhabitng a corpse. i feel like the life story already finished, and i'm just stuck in the credits playing over and over.",
