    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so illogical. you talk about \"rewriting chapters,\" but how can you write anything if the protagonist is dead? the person who mattered isn't here anymore. it's like... if a movie ended and the screen just went black, you wouldn't try to film a sequel with a different actor in the same suit. it's just unnatural. i feel like i'm just dragging out an ending that should have happened a long time ago.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
